  "description": "Long-Range 48V Battery & High-Speed Performance\n\nPowered by a 48V 20.8Ah certified removable battery, this bike offers up to 80 miles of range in PAS mode—ideal for extended rides and daily commuting. Combined with a 1200W peak brushless motor, it easily reaches speeds of up to 33 MPH. Smooth acceleration and steady power delivery ensure an efficient, reliable ride across both urban roads and off-road terrain.\n\nFull Suspension System & Adjustable Seat: Comfort for Every Rider\n\nFeaturing a dual suspension setup with both front and rear shock absorption, this bike effectively reduces impact from uneven surfaces for a smoother ride. It maintains stability across trails and rough roads alike. The adjustable seat height is designed to suit a wide range of riders, providing a comfortable and ergonomic fit for teens and adults.\n\n20\"×4.0\" Fat Tires: All-Terrain Confidence and Control\n\nFitted with large 20\"×4.0\" fat tires, this bike delivers enhanced traction and stability on diverse terrains. Whether riding on sand, snow, hills, or city streets, the wide tires improve grip and balance. Take on different environments with confidence, supported by reliable performance across changing surfaces.\n\n7-Speed Gear System & Safety Features: Smooth and Secure Riding\n\nThe 7-speed gear system gives you full control over pedaling intensity, making it easier to handle inclines and maintain comfortable cruising speeds. A clear LCD display shows key ride data such as speed and battery level at a glance. Equipped with a bright headlight and rear reflector, it enhances visibility for safer riding in low-light conditions.\n\nHeadlight & Taillight: Enhanced Visibility and Safer Riding\n\nEquipped with a powerful headlight featuring dual high-intensity LED bulbs, it delivers 30% greater brightness for clearer illumination ahead. The focused beam improves visibility while minimizing glare and light scatter for oncoming traffic. A rear red LED automatically lights up when braking, increasing awareness and ensuring you stay visible during night rides.",
